(Separated…)

12
00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:45.510
Porque todos somos distintas piezas del mundo,

13
00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:44.540
Like a puzzle missing pieces thrown off to the side

14
00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:46.950
(We’re missing pieces…)

15
00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:51.070
que se unen como compañeros una tras otra.

16
00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:52.710
But just you wait, one day that puzzle will be whole

17
00:00:51.070 --> 00:01:03.910
Mientras las piezas toman forma, el viento seguirá soplando. ¡Sí!

18
00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:59.240
And when we come together, I can feel the wind blowing strong, YEAH!

19
00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:05.330
Feel the wind, take it all in, you’ve gotta let the wind flow by

20
00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:10.000
Así que cuando sientas el viento, debes sentirlo soplar.

21
00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:11.400
Should you feel your eyes welling up, you’ve gotta search out the wind, let it dry your tears

22
00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:16.180
Salgamos a buscar el viento que seque nuestras lágrimas.

23
00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:17.410
On a quest looking for friends, can’t wait to see how big our family gets

24
00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:21.970
Estamos en una aventura para encontrar a ese alguien.

25
00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:20.910
Nothing can stop this dream of mine

26
00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:29.780
I can feel somebody waiting just out of sight, I’ll see you soon

27
00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:32.980
No pararemos. Mira amor, ahí estás enfrente mío, esperándome.

